{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_058_latent_diffusion-title\">Latent Diffusion</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">先以 autoencoder 压缩图像，再在 latent grid 上运行可 cross-attention 条件化的 diffusion。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Perceptually compresses high-resolution images into a lower-dimensional spatial latent grid via a VQ/KL autoencoder before running cross-attention-conditioned diffusion.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像 x 与可选条件 c；生成时为 latent 高斯噪声 zT</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution image x (encoded to z_0 = E(x)) + optional multimodal conditioning c (text, mask, layout)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">由解码器还原的高分辨率图像 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution synthesized image x̂ = D(ẑ_0) decoded from denoised latent grid</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Rombach_High-Resolution_Image_Synthesis_With_Latent_Diffusion_Models_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Latent Diffusion original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/855dec856e4895bf939a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图像 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">像素空间训练样本</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution image x (encoded to z_0 = e(x)) + optional multimodal conditioning c (text, mask, layout) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"像素空间训练样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests high-resolution image x (encoded to z_0 = e(x)) + optional multimodal conditioning c (text, mask, layout) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"图像 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">像素空间训练样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution image x (encoded to z_0 = e(x)) + optional multimodal conditioning c (text, mask, layout) and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"感知/对抗正则的 autoencoder 将 x 压缩到 z0\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes VAE encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"VAE 编码器\" data-node-name-en=\"VAE encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">VAE 编码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">VAE encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">感知/对抗正则的 autoencoder 将 x 压缩到 z0</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes VAE encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"较低空间分辨率、较高语义密度的连续网格\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs latent z0 within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"latent z0\" data-node-name-en=\"latent z0\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>latent z0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">较低空间分辨率、较高语义密度的连续网格</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs latent z0 within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"q(z_t|z0) 在潜空间逐步加入高斯噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs latent within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"latent 加噪\" data-node-name-en=\"latent\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">latent 加噪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">latent</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">q(z_t|z0) 在潜空间逐步加入高斯噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs latent within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"文本或其他模态经 cross-attention 注入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"条件 c\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">条件 c</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">文本或其他模态经 cross-attention 注入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"epsilon_theta(z_t,t,c) 在 latent grid 上预测噪声/score\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs U-Net score within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"U-Net score\" data-node-name-en=\"U-Net score\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>U-Net score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">epsilon_theta(z_t,t,c) 在 latent grid 上预测噪声/score</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs U-Net score within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"DDPM、DDIM 等 solver 从 zT 迭代到 z0_hat\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SDE / ODE within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"逆 SDE / ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"SDE / ODE\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">逆 SDE / ODE</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SDE / ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">DDPM、DDIM 等 solver 从 zT 迭代到 z0_hat</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SDE / ODE within the core latent conditional diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把 z0_hat 映射回像素空间\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies VAE decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"VAE 解码器\" data-node-name-en=\"VAE decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">VAE 解码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">VAE decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把 z0_hat 映射回像素空间</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies VAE decoder to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"高分辨率生成或条件转换结果\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces high-resolution synthesized image x̂ = d(ẑ_0) decoded from denoised latent grid via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_058_latent_diffusion', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高分辨率生成或条件转换结果</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces high-resolution synthesized image x̂ = d(ẑ_0) decoded from denoised latent grid via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Latent Diffusion Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 潜空间条件扩散训练目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Conditional Denoising Diffusion Inside a Perceptually Compressed Autoencoder Latent Space</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Latent Diffusion：核心公式 · 潜空间条件扩散训练目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img